  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health / Root",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Hello",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Basic service health check / greeting.\n\n**Auth/Role**: None (Public).\n\n**Preconditions**: Server running.\n\n**Expected Status**: 200 OK."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response body is Hello World!\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(\"Hello World!\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Sign Up",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{userPhone}}\",\n  \"gender\": \"{{userGender}}\",\n  \"age\": \"{{userAge}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Register a new user account with system credentials and trigger OTP email.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (signUpDTO):\n- `name`: string, not empty\n- `email`: valid email string, not empty\n- `password`: string, not empty\n- `phone_number`: string, not empty\n- `gender`: enum `userGender` ('male' | 'female'), not empty\n- `age`: string, not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: Email and phone number must not already be confirmed/registered.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Response**: `{\"message\": \"please confirm your email\"}`"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Returns confirmation prompt message\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res.message).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse signup response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Confirm Email (Sign Up OTP)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/confirm",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "signup", "confirm"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Confirm user registration using OTP sent via email/RabbitMQ.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (confirmEmailDTO):\n- `email`: valid email, not empty\n- `otp`: string, exactly 5 characters (`@Length(5, 5)`), not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: Step 1 (Sign Up) has run and OTP has been obtained from Redis cache (`confirm-sign-up::<email>`) or email inbox and set into `{{otpCode}}`.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Response**: `{\"message\": \"email confirmed\"}`"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Email confirmed successfully\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res.message).to.eql(\"email confirmed\");",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse confirm email response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Sign In (Login)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Authenticate using email and password to receive JWT access and refresh tokens.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (signInDTO):\n- `email`: valid email, not empty\n- `password`: string, not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: User registered and confirmed.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Captures**: `accessToken` and `refreshToken` into Postman environment."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res && res.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", res.accessToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (res && res.refreshToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", res.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.test(\"Captured accessToken and refreshToken\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res).to.have.property('accessToken');",
                  "        pm.expect(res).to.have.property('refreshToken');",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse login response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "bearer {{refreshToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Issue a new pair of access and refresh tokens using an unrevoked refresh token in the `authorization` header.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Requires valid refresh token in `authorization` header (`bearer <refreshToken>`). Note that it revokes the old refresh token in the database upon rotation.\n\n**Preconditions**: Step 3 (Sign In) or Step 8 (Register Guest) completed to obtain a valid `refreshToken`.\n\n**Expected Status**: 200 OK.\n\n**Captures**: Updates `accessToken` and `refreshToken` in the environment."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res && res.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", res.accessToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (res && res.refreshToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", res.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.test(\"Updated tokens on refresh\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res).to.have.property('accessToken');",
                  "        pm.expect(res).to.have.property('refreshToken');",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse refresh token response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Forget Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forget-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forget-password"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Request password reset OTP for an existing user account.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (forgetPasswordDTO):\n- `email`: valid email, not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: Account with this email must exist in the database.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Response**: `{\"message\": \"an otp has sent to your email\"}`"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Returns OTP sent message\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res.message).to.eql(\"an otp has sent to your email\");",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse forget password response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Resend OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "resend-otp"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Resend password reset OTP with rate limiting / attempt tracking in Redis.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (forgetPasswordDTO):\n- `email`: valid email, not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: Account exists and user is not currently blocked by rate limiting.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Returns OTP resent message\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(res.message).to.eql(\"an otp has sent to your email\");",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.error(\"Failed to parse resend OTP response:\", e);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Confirm OTP (Password Reset OTP Verification)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "confirm-otp"]
            },
            "description": "**Purpose**: Verify the OTP code for password reset and receive fresh session tokens.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Validation Requirements** (confirmEmailDTO):\n- `email`: valid email, not empty\n- `otp`: string, exactly 5 chars, not empty\n\n**Preconditions**: Forget password OTP requested and retrieved into `{{otpCode}}`.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Captures**: Updates `accessToken` and `refreshToken`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "try {",
