            "description": "**Purpose**: Create an anonymous guest user account with role `guest` and return guest JWT tokens.\n\n**Auth/Role**: Public.\n\n**Preconditions**: None.\n\n**Expected Status**: 201 Created.\n\n**Captures**: `guestAccessToken` and `guestRefreshToken`."
